{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "26b86354-bfb5-5a38-8cc8-a93411421dd1", "source_ordinal": 1258, "reading_ordinal": 2799, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "病患护理", "published_at": "2024-09-28T18:09:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/434987991/answer/3719372980"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "家里遇到这种低自理能力的照顾需求，一般都有几个通用的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "第一个，积极加入病友群，分享经验教训，获得精神支持和必要资讯。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第二个，先力求达到某种可以维持的稳定状态，再考虑寻求改善。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所谓可维持的稳定状态，是指照顾者本人可以有效维持而被照顾者生理、心理状态稳定的状态。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "很多人在这里认为受照顾者要优先，宁可照顾者自己累一点，也要尽可能的让被照顾者感觉尽可能良好——即所谓“筋疲力竭地提供无微不至的照顾”，但这实际上是不明智的。因为：", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）照顾者透支自己的可持续性去达成的“无微不至的照顾”实际上是不可持续的。一旦黄金期过去，照顾者自己贫病交加，受照顾者就要面对更坏的处境，很可能从长期看受照顾者得到的照顾总量反而更少。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "另一方面，受照顾者是从一个更好的体验急剧的或者至少渐进的滑落到这个很差的处境，这种一日不如一日的长期负预期是一个很大的精神上的额外折磨。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，必须要量力而行，按照自己可以尽可能长期承受的前提去提供高于维生底线的恰当照顾，而不是透支自身的完美照顾。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "2）照顾者一旦决定提供尽可能完美的照顾，几乎不可避免要“勒令”或期待自己的社会关系网为自己的这个决定做出支持或至少配合。这往往不但导致照顾者自认为可以免除一切社会责任，还认为社会有了无限的支援义务。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "很遗憾，社会不是这么看待这个问题的。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "社会会提供援助的前提一向都是你仍然在坚持承担你的社会义务。例如单位给你援助的前提是你仍然在坚持履行职责，亲戚坚持给你援助的前提是你仍然在坚持履行亲戚守望相助的义理，甚至夫妇在坚持援助的前提都是你仍然在履行夫妻义务。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "社会的援助责任和你继续承担社会责任的状态息息相关，而在“完美照顾”这个做法下，照顾者往往第一个决定抛弃的就是这些义务——夫妻义务先丢掉了，子女都这样了，你还指望我给你什么安慰和帮助？亲戚走动丢掉了，子女都这样了，你还指望我怎么跟你礼尚往来？工作精神丢掉了，子女都这样了，你还指望我怎么尽忠职守？", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "然而你一旦用子女的不幸来用作拒绝承担这些社会责任的理由，这些相关人虽然嘴上不会公然说出来，但在心中会不可避免的产生对你不幸子女甚至你本人的憎恶。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这实际上是在主张一种单向的剥削。", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "对方可以接受你尽八分甚至五分责，给你九分甚至十分回报，但是对方很难接受你不尽任何责，平白给你两分哪怕一分回报。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 957}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为这样事情性质就变了，你明不明白？", "char_start": 958, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，你把本来准备倾注到被照顾者身上的十分精力撤回五分来，去向你的社会关系网尽五分力，换ta们从四面八方给你七分到十分回报，然后利用这多得的几分净收益去补充你抽出的五分照顾精力，这个循环是可以运转的，可以长期持续的。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但你如果决定把十分精力全部投入到向被照顾者提供尽可能完美的服务，你将很快耗尽社会关系网的耐心，陷入离婚、失业、断亲、自身健康日薄西山的绝境，而被照顾者只能无力的坐在一边眼睁睁的看着你把ta变成你自己毁灭的原因。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "事情搞成这样，你绝不能总结为“我极为高尚，世界太功利自私”，而要总结为你过度软弱且贪婪，没有勇气做正确的事。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1246}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要理会某些世俗的指指点点，考虑长远，做对所有人最明智的选择。照顾者健康、安宁、可持续，被照顾者自然也情绪稳定，生理上也会很快适应新的稳定节奏，可以在这个基础上循环改进，由低谷向上。", "char_start": 1247, "char_end": 1338}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "3）要充当被照顾者与一般社会之间的缓冲。", "char_start": 1339, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "例如，ta的衣物上一定要有比较显眼的你的联系电话。这样万一ta无意间和一般社会接触、和一般社会秩序发生矛盾而你又不在场，这个电话可以成为ta的一大保障——对方会在动手打骂驱逐之前和你先联系，把情节走向导向良性方向。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1467}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "很多精神病患者自己在外犯病，对不明就里的一般民众而言只会感觉到自己受到了无理侵犯，人家哪知道这是真不正常还是装不正常搞事？再说人家未必愿意在结论搞不清楚的前提下无限的容忍下去。", "char_start": 1468, "char_end": 1556}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "无论是人家报警还是人家动手，对被照顾者而言都是一场巨大的刺激。", "char_start": 1557, "char_end": 1588}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这类情况还有很多，万不可因为觉得“会被歧视”而低估被误解的风险。", "char_start": 1589, "char_end": 1621}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "上面说的是保底的问题，是如何在困境之中先稳住脚步的问题。", "char_start": 1623, "char_end": 1651}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "然后再谈如何在困境中力求向上的问题。", "char_start": 1652, "char_end": 1670}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "1）精神病患者不是一无是处的，ta们往往也有超常规的创造能力，只是这些创造力是不受控的、无序发散的。如果能善加引导、有序记录，未必不能结出某种果子。", "char_start": 1671, "char_end": 1745}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "最起码，这些创作作为一份诊疗资料加以利用，也有助于医疗机构寻找更有效的治疗方案。", "char_start": 1746, "char_end": 1786}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "2）任何残疾、重病患者，只要能坚持战斗，乐观的生活，就天然的带有激励属性。不管是出书、直播，都会有天然的流量。", "char_start": 1787, "char_end": 1842}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这种流量是天赐的优势，没有必要有无谓的纠结。", "char_start": 1843, "char_end": 1865}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你只是要注意——你的价值不在于“惨”“可怜”“值得同情”，而在于不屈不挠，值得关注和敬佩。", "char_start": 1866, "char_end": 1911}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这里说的不是被照顾者，而是照顾者。", "char_start": 1912, "char_end": 1929}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "无论如何，上天保佑勇敢的人。", "char_start": 1930, "char_end": 1944}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "祝你们好运。", "char_start": 1945, "char_end": 1951}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女儿14岁，一年前出现幻听幻觉，被诊断为精神分裂。她的未来怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“病患护理”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“家里遇到这种低自理能力的照顾需求，一般都有几个通用的做法。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "家里遇到这种低自理能力的照顾需求，一般都有几个通用的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ba725db6-a4a3-5d63-a45d-33eabd849398", "source_ordinal": 1257, "reading_ordinal": 2800, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "世交", "published_at": "2024-09-28T20:20:44+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/15b08c0a7d9411ef90e952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一个非常简单的小诀窍——“家酿”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "可以是啤酒、葡萄酒、咸蛋、皮蛋、粽子、年糕、饺子、鱼干、枇杷、桃子……", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "任何没有禁忌、但需要年复一年、精益求精、精心制作的家庭特产。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "亲手制作，用料上乘，品质精良，包装精美。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "每年一批，诚挚敬上。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你收到了，是自用也好、送人也好、丢掉也好，都随便，也不需要回礼或者感恩。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我以个人人品向你保证，这东西已经极尽了我的诚意。配料、选材、制作过程都有视频记录，并且我自己会先尝为敬。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我的意思，我的纪念，都在这东西里面了。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你在这个名单上，年复一年，直到我死后我的子孙接替。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个世界上，我家我姓存在一天，你家你姓就不会缺了这一味。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "年年秋天，这东西都会附上第一批秋叶，亲笔作词，送到你门上。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "直到“查无此人”为止。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只要你家里守住这个礼节，你家就不会亡于无援。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这里特别补充一个要点——包装不要“家常”，这对人是一种无形的侮辱。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "包装要尽可能的精美，要高于一般市场产品的品质。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "谁说手工包装就一定粗糙、一定不如商业产品？", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 429}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-09/28/c53e0e153174727c1cc59ee380517d08.jpeg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-09/28/d1fd3658a9faca7a59b4b2a97a143470.jpeg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2024-09/28/64c2822d4e0f083cb83bc98e6fff9a89.jpeg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21, "image": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：除了过节问候以外，还有哪些更有效的方式来维护“友好、互利但不常联系”的关系？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“世交”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一个非常简单的小诀窍——“家酿”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一个非常简单的小诀窍——“家酿”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b1fb817f-c6f7-5a07-b667-5921c235bbe7", "source_ordinal": 1256, "reading_ordinal": 2801, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "噤", "published_at": "2024-09-28T20:52:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/668055839/answer/3725212334"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我谈不上支持罗翔的学术观点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但是我坚决反对现在这种“对人不对事”的暴力风气。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "搞这种攻击的人必须要回答一个问题——你们想要通过这种“杀一儆百”建立一种什么样的讨论规则？一种什么样的学术伦理？", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "法律、学术不是帮派斗争，每判一个人、一件事错，都是在改变自己的规则、重新型塑社会的行为规范。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样去“打倒罗翔”，是要树立一种什么样的社会规范？如果你都没有胆量直接堂而皇之的说出来，一心想着靠“曝尸荒野”来暗示、隐喻，那么这只是在制造社会恐怖。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是一种舆论恐怖主义行为。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为某种恐怖主义行为刚好残害的是自己不喜欢的人而为恐怖主义叫好，这不过是一种同流合污而已。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "别人怎么想我不管，我不会赞成。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 295}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么支持罗翔的人，总是闭口不谈他曾经写的论文——取消煽动分裂国家罪、煽动颠覆国家政权罪？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“噤”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我谈不上支持罗翔的学术观点。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我谈不上支持罗翔的学术观点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a473c710-ae93-5387-922d-64d2e432e9bb", "source_ordinal": 1255, "reading_ordinal": 2802, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "逝者如斯夫", "published_at": "2024-09-29T11:09:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/667566553/answer/3751341447"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为钱不花会躺在账户里，而时间每天都会自然流逝。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为可避免的东西没被避免而感到不安是有意义的。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为不可避免的东西没被避免而感到不安几乎是没有意义的。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在时间问题上，时间的流逝是无可避免的，只有时间的流逝没有沉淀出意义和价值才是可避免的，因此，人不会因为一觉醒来时间少了一天而不安，但会为少了的这一天没有带来任何成果、经验甚至记忆而感到不安。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 170}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：钱花了能再赚，但卡里余额减少人就不安；而时间是纯消耗品，为何人不会一觉醒来因生命又少一天而心生惶恐？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“逝者如斯夫”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为钱不花会躺在账户里，而时间每天都会自然流逝。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为钱不花会躺在账户里，而时间每天都会自然流逝。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ca2b40e7-4e45-58b9-8fbd-e069f06cb513", "source_ordinal": 1254, "reading_ordinal": 2803, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "因大失小", "published_at": "2024-09-29T11:34:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/528006880/answer/3754536550"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很显然，你跟大领导关系并不像你想的那么好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为如果真如你想象的那么好，对你的指导、培养会被大领导明确纳入小领导的业绩考核指标之中，ta信不信任你都得照办。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "该怎么办？", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "打破幻想，脚踏实地。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "作为领导者、管理者，其实没人会故意不指导下属，任由下属低级试错浪费时间和资源。下属觉得没有得到指导，只有两类原因——要么是存在个人关系之外的原因宁可业绩受损也不要指导你，例如觉得你是某个敌人派来的卧底；要么是指导了，发现收效甚微甚至有反效果，还不如省点力气在别人身上。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而且九成九都是后一种原因。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "同样是点拨一句，你无动于衷甚至还要背后耻笑几句“不过如此”，别人积极响应、拿出结果，那么在用于指导的精力有限的前提下，当然优先倾注在别人身上。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "从ta们的视角看来，人生苦短，为什么要浪费在不识好歹甚至还倒打一耙的人身上？", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你要找原因，自己从这些方向去检查一下。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 375}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我现在处于跟大领导关系好，却跟着小领导干，都服从小领导，但是小领导却不信任我不愿意指导我，该怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“因大失小”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很显然，你跟大领导关系并不像你想的那么好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很显然，你跟大领导关系并不像你想的那么好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "82c3122f-188f-581e-bc41-380e2f7a794b", "source_ordinal": 1253, "reading_ordinal": 2804, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不吃素", "published_at": "2024-09-29T12:15:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/677506030/answer/3758864273"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "最近有个很有意思的事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有一个yter叫柳杰克，节目的主要形式是在线和各种来宾聊天，其中有一名常客，是一名长期把“参军”“沙滩见”挂在嘴边的深绿家庭出身的高雄少女。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这就是那种经典的“深绿天然独”，从小到大基本没有听过一句大陆好话的小孩。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "结果高中毕业决定到大陆来读大学了，立场上来了个一百八十度大转弯，用柳杰克的原话形容，就是“已经变成了gcd的形状”。满嘴的“特殊国情”“把十几亿人口的国家治理好不容易”“投票也没那么重要”。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "毫无“台湾价值”了已经。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "契机主要是两个—— 一个是在台湾前途不理想，一个是到大陆来旅游了几趟。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "类似郭正亮、钟鸣轩这些就更不提了。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个现象在未来会越来越高发——因为“出路不好”这事会越来越严重，而“到大陆一看受到重大现实洗礼”的效应会越来越强烈。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "和平统一的希望当然有，而且与一般人想象得不同——和平统一的希望从来没有这么大过。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "很多人设想的邪恶、谎言失败的过程是一天比一天虚弱、式微，最后走向消亡，这其实是一个错误的预想。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果你仔细查看历史，你会发现ta们走向失败的过程恰好相反，是一天比一天强横、狂暴，甚至到达了捕风捉影、白色恐怖的顶峰，到了老百姓道路以目、噤若寒蝉的近乎“绝对安全”的极致，然后突然轰然倒塌。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它要走过一个至暗时刻，由“盛极”而骤衰。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这不是一个由50%平稳下降到0%的过程，而是一个由50%上涨到90%然后在极短时间内突然跌落到-10%的过程。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "糊涂人会因为“50%升到80%，而且看上去要升级到90%”感到悲观绝望，明白人却会因此感到振奋和乐观。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "“平缓衰落而后浴火重生”是正义事业的特征，“盛极猝死”则是邪恶事业的共同命运。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这两者恰恰是互相对称的，发现了吗？", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "正义事业平缓衰落的过程，正是邪恶事业逐渐锦上添花的过程。而正义事业越是衰落到极点、邪恶事业越是烈火烹油，反而距离前者陡然浴火重生、后者轰然倒塌越近。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这也是为什么正义事业越近衰微时，同志越坚贞不屈，因为其实胜利近了，而邪恶事业越繁花似锦，恶人越癫狂虚无——因为ta知道ta们经不起下坡路，一旦气势顿挫，一切都会卷入恶性链式反应，转眼间化为虚无。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以，不要以为台独从5分进到8分，看上去还要进到9分就以为“和平统一无望”。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "恰恰相反，这是和平统一要进入真正不可阻挡的阶段的迹象。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为它这是邪恶的事业，是不造血、只吸血的事业。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 978}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不要以为老天爷是吃干饭的。", "char_start": 979, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "ta何止不吃干饭，ta干脆连素都不吃。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1012}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待赖清德说“台湾绝不可能签‘和平协议’，要靠实力确保和平”，两岸和平统一还有希望吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“不吃素”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“最近有个很有意思的事。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "最近有个很有意思的事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "afe8018d-f3a4-53bb-a5b9-955e1b23de8b", "source_ordinal": 1252, "reading_ordinal": 2805, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "敬我自己一杯", "published_at": "2024-09-29T12:57:38+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/59ac73b67e1f11efbbf852540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“敬酒”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "敬酒的意思是你就是接受祭祀的对象，对方到你面前举杯致辞，自己喝掉，表示敬意，你举举杯、甚至点点头，表示看到了，知道了，这叫敬酒。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举杯说“敬酒”，但ta喝一杯，你也必须喝对等的一杯，你不喝就是看不起ta、不给ta面子，这种“敬酒”，敬的不是你。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "敬的是ta自己。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta根本不是在敬酒，而是在“赐饮”。这才是ta这么做的根本原因。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你如果确实需要哀求别人赏生意做，求人给你一点生路，你就认清楚自己的位置——赐饮当然是不能让别人代领的。错不在下属，而是在你示意的时候你就已经失礼了。对方去责怪下属，属于给你留了转圜余地，其实斥责的是你本人。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你要开口，只有谢罪一条路。具体怎么说，你就自己看着办。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换一个角度，如果你是老老实实做生意，这是互惠互利，你没有什么哀求对方的性质，那么你就可以随意得多。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我的建议是这样——你要寻求去提供最优质的、昂贵的、门槛很高的服务，以至于任何人光是得到这个交易机会都要脱层皮，付出高昂的沉没成本。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样可以基本杜绝这类不愉快的体验。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我出手都是救人命的工作，排着队等我救命的人多的是，你要排几个月的队、填上无数的表才有机会跟我坐到一个桌上，借你个胆子，你玩一下“不给面子”游戏试试？", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这样，我不胜酒力，早上还有手术要做，今天就到这里吧。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "有空再联系。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 548}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：带下属应酬，我示意下属帮我挡酒，客人对他说“你没资格和我喝”，我该直接接话吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“敬我自己一杯”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“敬酒”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“敬酒”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "84452840-fa75-5a15-a290-4003b8217bfe", "source_ordinal": 1251, "reading_ordinal": 2806, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "血性", "published_at": "2024-09-29T15:05:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/639171545/answer/3773921169"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说句实话，论起战斗精神，这个世界上没有人是中国的对手。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国军队有一种“血性”，一旦激发了，根本视死亡如无物。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那不是什么“天堂有七十二处女”或者“瓦尔哈拉无限畅饮”的诱惑下的“欣然交易”，也不是日本式的“如樱花凋谢”般的“死亡理想”，也不是“富贵险中求”的极端投机主义。而是一种令人难以理解的，冷静的、决绝的、毫无保留的、而且是链式自激的默然的牺牲精神。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其确切的动机和理性逻辑事实上是神秘的、缺少研究的。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "就是单纯的班长上去了，没完成任务，副班长上去了也没完成任务，老子把帽子拽下来往下一扔，老子就不信这个邪。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "非把你这个碉堡炸上天不可。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这样，我先举高胳膊中一弹，然后趴下装死。等你转头去射击后面的同志时，我抱着炸药包冲进去拉线，我就不信干不掉你。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后ta就做到了。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这期间ta有没有思考这对个人的严重后果、对国家民族的历史价值、对家族亲眷的附带影响……坦率讲，是不得而知的。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为如果是一两个英雄人物也罢了，这样做的中国军人从古到今数量实在太多。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "太多太多。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你很难全部用“畏惧军法”“想上天堂”“有理想”之类的理性理由全部解释。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "总之就是会有数量令人难以置信的军人仿佛对死亡、伤残失去了感受一样，做出英勇都不足以形容的勇猛行为，使得很多按照“人总会怕疼、怕伤、怕死”的假设设定的作战计划出人意料的失败。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而且是一而再、再而三的失败。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "以至于习惯按这个逻辑来构想战略战术的敌人突然一下不知道仗该怎么打了。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个“血性”到底是什么，很难解释。但是一旦战争进入到一定阶段，这种“血性”就会发作。敌人面对的就是一支极端任务导向、高度机动灵活而又毫不畏惧牺牲的部队。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "就像自己的命是刮奖抽来的，胳膊是可以再生的，除了不能浪费，用起来没一点保守。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "做尖刀、选锋、先登的这些人，就是军队的精华，是军魂所系。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 752}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而更关键的是，ta们的高伤亡率往往不但不会令剩下的人感到恐惧退缩，反而会连环激发没有入选者的更强烈的血性导致尖刀越来越锐利、越来越多，最后压倒对手的承受能力。", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这是文化深处的核心力量，是华夏文明的天赋。", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 854}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "敌人想不通这是为什么，想不通就对了。", "char_start": 855, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "正是因为没人想得通，所以这力量才会引起对手无法克服的恐惧和我军无法挫败的信心。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "那么容易能想通，你自己不就会了？", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 930}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0406"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：最近回看大决战，为什么解放军战士都以做攻坚克难的尖刀为荣，做尖刀不是更容易牺牲吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“血性”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说句实话，论起战斗精神，这个世界上没有人是中国的对手。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说句实话，论起战斗精神，这个世界上没有人是中国的对手。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
